    ],
    "text": "The wave height may increase about (2 \u2013 3) meters in the sea areas off the coast extending from Mannar to Pottuvil via Colombo, Galle and Hambantota. The near shore sea areas from Chilaw to Matara via Colombo and Galle may experience surges as well.",
